# Python Tutorial: Building a Data Processing Pipeline with Tests

*(Session reference: b23c1daada888af93a903355dd734d38, stream 0)*

This tutorial walks through building a complete, tested data-processing pipeline in Python. We'll cover functions, classes, generators, error handling, file I/O, and unit testing with `pytest`.

---

## 1. Project Setup

Create this structure:

```
pipeline/
├── pipeline/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── cleaning.py
│   ├── stats.py
│   └── io_utils.py
└── tests/
    ├── test_cleaning.py
    ├── test_stats.py
    └── test_io_utils.py
```

Install pytest:

```bash
pip install pytest
```

